@ErpCosmetiqueApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5138

### Tableau de bord
GET {{ErpCosmetiqueApi_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard

### Produits
GET {{ErpCosmetiqueApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
GET {{ErpCosmetiqueApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/low-stock

### Vente au comptoir
POST {{ErpCosmetiqueApi_HostAddress}}/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "employeeId": 1,
  "lines": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ],
  "discountAmount": 0,
  "discountPercent": 0,
  "paymentMode": 1
}

### Dépense caisse (repas, transport...)
POST {{ErpCosmetiqueApi_HostAddress}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cashBoxId": 1,
  "employeeId": 1,
  "amount": 2500,
  "motive": "Déjeuner équipe"
}

### Rapport journalier
GET {{ErpCosmetiqueApi_HostAddress}}/api/reports/daily

### Facture PDF
GET {{ErpCosmetiqueApi_HostAddress}}/api/invoices/1/pdf
